Third-party software in the passkey fixture container (test/passkey-rp)
=======================================================================

The container is a test tool of Faithful Ferret (U4, the passkey matrix). It runs only on a
test host, behind an internal Docker network. Its dependencies are only test dependencies:
they are never part of a package, a release archive, the server image or the web vault of
Faithful Ferret, and the product's own dependency graph (Cargo.lock, the server's lock, the
extension) does not contain them. This file records them as the plan requires (UK128); the
list that ships with the product is THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.

Relying-party libraries (the two fixtures)
------------------------------------------

webauthn-rs-core 0.6.2 and webauthn-rs-proto 0.6.2   MPL-2.0
    https://github.com/kanidm/webauthn-rs
