Their dependencies
------------------

The Rust crates the fixture depends on (232 in Cargo.lock) are licensed MIT, Apache-2.0, Unicode-3.0,
BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, Zlib, Unlicense or MPL-2.0 (four crates, among them webauthn-attestation-ca, webauthn-rs-core and webauthn-rs-proto). The
npm packages of the fixture server (23 with the two above, in server/package-lock.json) are
MIT, BSD-3-Clause (asn1js), Apache-2.0 (reflect-metadata) or 0BSD (tslib). None is copyleft
beyond the file-level MPL-2.0 of webauthn-rs.

Code of other projects
----------------------

No code of Bitwarden or AliasVault (GPL-3.0, AGPL-3.0) is in this directory. Where U4 later
copies from them (UK128), the copied file keeps its header, gets an SPDX line and "Modified by
Faithful Ferret", and goes into notices-extra.json.
